  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "WebSocket Protocol Layer Refactoring & Optimization:\n      - High-Performance Composition Architecture: Decoupled WebSocket protocol logic into a standalone 'WsSessionProtocol' engine, reducing proxy layers and enhancing JIT inlining.\n      - Unified Client/Server API: Harmonized 'WssClient', 'WsClient', 'WssSession', and 'WsSession' with a consistent, symmetric API for text, binary, and control frames.\n      - Zero-Copy & Low-Allocation: Optimized receive paths using 'Lucifer.Rent<Buffer>' to perform zero-copy string extraction and binary appending directly from internal buffers.\n      - Enhanced Memory Management: Centralized buffer lifecycle management within the protocol core, ensuring strict ownership transfer during asynchronous send operations.\n      - Improved Handshake Flow: Streamlined synchronous and asynchronous WebSocket upgrade logic for both secure (WSS) and standard (WS) connections.\n      - Performance-First: Applied 'MethodImplOptions.AggressiveInlining' across the entire protocol stack to ensure near-zero overhead for high-frequency messaging.",
